}],"agent_notes":["The exact institution appears in all three supplied NIRF 2025 government-directory pages with Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh.","The first normal TLS request produced the managed proxy's self-signed certificate-chain error; curl --insecure was then used only for public GET requests to the expected NIRF, search, and corporatebpl.com hosts.","The official CIST campus pages identify Hathaikheda near Patel Nagar, Raisen Road, Bhopal - 462022.","The official catalogue is internally inconsistent: ProgramsOffered.php lists MBA specializations including Data Analytics and Travel and Tourism Management and shows only one M.Tech intake row, while ProgramsOffered.html lists MBA General Management, omits those two MBA specializations, and shows both M.Tech intake rows. The CIST MBA.php page independently confirms MBA and MBA General Management but presents a different specialization list.","The courses record programme families explicitly named on official CIST pages; duration and eligibility remain null because no central official CIST catalogue page explicitly verifies them.","No diploma, certificate, or doctoral programme was listed on the official CIST catalogue pages reviewed.","Corporate Institute of Management pages were excluded because the target institution is Corporate Institute of Science & Technology."]}